# 17. VISUAL ACCEPTANCE STANDARD

Evaluate the final result across these dimensions:

| Dimension | Weight |
|---|---:|
| Global art direction | 15 |
| Briefing first-screen impact | 20 |
| Overall page composition | 15 |
